Intended use and additional terms
---------------------------------
This data was collected from consenting participants under an approved
Institutional Review Board protocol, and released in de-identified form only.
The non-commercial term reflects what participants consented to.

The data is released for research on evaluating individualized reasoning in
language models. It must not be used to build systems that persuade, profile,
or target individuals, and it must not be treated as a tool for inferring or
manipulating the beliefs of people who did not consent to this study.

Participants retain the right to withdraw. Requests for removal of a
participant's records will be honored, and affected releases retracted.
